{"page":242,"width":1784,"height":2390,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"6.1 탐색 알고리즘의 개요","words":[{"text":"6.1","x":228,"y":202,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"탐색","x":331,"y":198,"width":88,"height":45},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":439,"y":199,"width":214,"height":45},{"text":"개요","x":672,"y":200,"width":85,"height":43}]},{"text":"우리가 잘 알고 있는 것처럼 탐색은 \u0027무언가를 찾는다라는 의미를 가진 단어입니다. 컴퓨터 세계에","words":[{"text":"우리가","x":228,"y":287,"width":102,"height":33},{"text":"잘","x":341,"y":287,"width":34,"height":32},{"text":"알고","x":386,"y":288,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"있는","x":462,"y":288,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"것처럼","x":535,"y":288,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"탐색은","x":634,"y":288,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"\u0027무언가를","x":734,"y":287,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"찾는다라는","x":872,"y":287,"width":162,"height":33},{"text":"의미를","x":1045,"y":287,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"가진","x":1147,"y":287,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"단어입니다.","x":1216,"y":286,"width":158,"height":33},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1391,"y":286,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"세계에","x":1491,"y":286,"width":93,"height":32}]},{"text":"서 그 무언가는 \u0027데이터로 정해져 있으므로 여기서 탐색은 \u0027데이터를 찾는다는 의미가 되지요.","words":[{"text":"서","x":229,"y":352,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"그","x":274,"y":355,"width":34,"height":24},{"text":"무언가는","x":317,"y":350,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"\u0027데이터로","x":456,"y":351,"width":140,"height":33},{"text":"정해져","x":606,"y":352,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"있으므로","x":706,"y":352,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"여기서","x":834,"y":350,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"탐색은","x":932,"y":350,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"\u0027데이터를","x":1032,"y":352,"width":112,"height":30},{"text":"찾는다는","x":1152,"y":352,"width":113,"height":29},{"text":"의미가","x":1273,"y":349,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"되지요.","x":1366,"y":349,"width":97,"height":33}]},{"text":"6장에서는 자료구조 형태에 따라 사용할 수 있는 여러 가지 탐색 알고리즘을 설명합니다. 이들 중","words":[{"text":"6장에서는","x":228,"y":426,"width":156,"height":34},{